End-to-End Flow:
1. User types a natural language question in M365 Copilot.
2. Copilot routes the question to the cmp Declarative Agent.
3. The agent extracts entities.
4. API Plugin calls Neo4j REST API.
5. REST API translates to Cypher.
6. Neo4j returns graph results.
7. REST API formats JSON and builds Power BI filter URL.
8. Copilot renders insights and Adaptive Card.
9. User clicks View in Power BI.
10. Power BI opens with filters already applied.

